  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "This Family BASIC homebrew is a Binary Land clone with a decent soundtrack and everything. If you've never played Binary Land, it's a puzzler where you control two penguins at the same time. The trick here is you have to get each set of Ink Wells at the same time while avoiding attacking creatures."
    }
